  m_text: "MOVEMENT:  WASD Move \xB7 SHIFT Sprint \xB7 SPACE Jump / Mantle\n\nSTANCES: 
    C / CTRL Crouch \xB7 X Hold Crouch \xB7 XX Slide \xB7 Z Prone\n\nCOMBAT:  LMB
    Fire \xB7 RMB Aim (ADS) \xB7 R Reload \xB7 G Frag Grenade\n\nTACTICAL:  Q Lean
    Left \xB7 E Lean Right \xB7 L Laser \xB7 F Resupply\n\nLOADOUT:  1 Primary \xB7
    2 Sidearm \xB7 3 Knife \xB7 4 Torch \xB7 SCROLL Swap\n\nOPTICS & MODS:  B Fire
    Mode \xB7 V Switch Sight (ADS) \xB7 I Inspect (1/2/3)\n\nSQUAD & MATCH:  T Squad
    Chat Orders \xB7 TAB Scoreboard \xB7 ESC Pause\n\nAll movement, stance and gear
    keys can be remapped under KEYBINDS."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
